## 3. Head, tokens and the scaling system

- Title: **Lacuna: a reading room for restless minds**. Meta description: "Lacuna is a members' reading room for deep, phone-down reading." UTF-8 charset, `width=device-width, initial-scale=1` viewport.
- Colour tokens: void `#050608` (page), navy `#0b0f17`, paper `#ece9e1` (main text on dark), mute `#8f8e89`, struck `#6b6a66`, hair `rgba(236,233,225,.14)` (all 1 px rules), key `#8a8a87` and key-shadow `#4a4a48` (keycap buttons), ticket `#f2f0ea`, ink `#111111`, **sheet** `#e9e5da` (the cream library cards and the typewriter sheet), **stamp** `#c8402a` (the one accent colour, used only on ink stamps and the focus caret).
