- The Footer is revealed from beneath the page like a curtain. Scattered letters fly together into a giant halftone-dotted LACUNA as it appears; the letters fill in near the pointer. The marquee reverses when you scroll up. The back-to-top ring fills as you scroll.
- The block cursor turns into a text selection over links and buttons.
- Reduced motion: everything shows its final state with no animation and no pinning.
